   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Experiences",
     "texto": [
      "To say whether something had happened before, use **før** (before), **aldrig** (never) or **endnu** (yet).",
      "Question: **Havde du været i Danmark før?** = Had you been to Denmark before?",
      "Answer: **Nej, jeg havde aldrig været der.** = No, I had never been there."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reasons",
     "texto": [
      "What had happened before can explain what happened later: **Jeg var træt, fordi jeg havde arbejdet hele dagen.** = I was tired because I had worked all day.",
      "With **fordi**, the auxiliary goes before the participle: **fordi jeg havde arbejdet**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
